OL,3,GNEWSABoy's football ground challenge
OL,4,Afor 'heart of gold' mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old Dundee boy is completing
OL,7,Ften laps of every professional football
OL,8,Fpitch in Scotland in memory of his late
OL,9,Fmother.
OL,11,FJacob McDonald is walking around the 42
OL,12,Fgrounds to raise money and awareness in
OL,13,Fhonour of his mum Vivienne, who died of
OL,14,Fa rare lung disease aged 32, when Jacob
OL,15,Fwas 18-months-old.
OL,17,FJacob's Ground Journeys will see him
OL,18,Fand his father Kenny travel more than
OL,19,F6,000 miles (9,656km) from Ross County
OL,20,Fto Stranraer with all the stops in
OL,21,Fbetween.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
